title: "The stability ceiling of connectome subtypes: analysis code"
abstract: >
  Closed-form stability ceiling for categorical neuroimaging subtypes, its
  Monte-Carlo validation, and the ABIDE I/ABIDE II analyses reported in
  "A measurement ceiling explains the developmental instability of autism
  connectivity subtypes".
